mindmap
  root((Offline visual fixture quality))
    breadth[Diagram family breadth]
      Multiple branches and sibling items
      Long labels that exercise wrapping and bounds
      Unicode examples: München, 東京, λ
    semantics(Meaningful deterministic data)
      Stable numeric values
      Fixed identities and labels
      No generated timestamps
    resilience{{Rendering edge cases}}
      Nested hierarchy
        Third-level child
        Another third-level child
      Mixed node shapes
      Labels near likely clipping boundaries
    review((Reviewer questions))
      Does every label remain visible?
      Do branches keep readable separation?
